@title Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban (USA, Europe)
@file Harry Potter and The Prisoner of Azkaban (UE) (M8).gba
@game BHTE
@chip EEPROM (64 Kbit: 8192-byte files from all three)
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# Language English US, the EA and licence screens, the title, New Game into
# slot 1, the storybook opening (Knight Bus to the Leaky Cauldron), the first
# room, then START > Save Game ("Saving Game", "Game Saved"). The language
# choice already writes the EEPROM header at boot; the slot is the first game
# save. [load]: no language screen (it was saved), the title menu now offers
# Load Game > slot 1 ("Talk to Cornelius Fudge, Level 1 00:00"), and the game
# resumes in the Leaky Cauldron.
# Notes (2026-10-15): leaky_cauldron (and [load] resumed) is MINOR between
# all three: 37-71 pixels, all in the light shaft by the stairs (x 111-133),
# one 5-bit step in a single channel, a different channel for each pair, the
# same every run; the shaft's palette is animated, so this reads as the
# animation's phase, not a dingbat-alone picture. The second reference's
# save differs in 2 bytes (offsets 57 and 2761, each by 1: a counter and its
# checksum, read the same by everyone). While the EEPROM is written the game
# stops its sound (f2925-3030): mgba gives digital silence, dingbat a low
# constant level, the second reference a higher one (each one's idle
# output); the music comes back at f3045 and dingbat's first quarter-second
# window after it (f3075) is 9 dB above both references, the restart's ramp
# falling a little earlier in the window.

[new]
wait 300
wait 300
checkpoint language window=30
press A after=120
wait 300
wait 300
checkpoint title window=30
press START after=120
press START after=120
checkpoint main_menu window=30
press A after=120
checkpoint slots window=30
press A after=120
checkpoint story window=30
press A after=120
tap A times=6 every=60 hold=4
checkpoint leaky_cauldron window=30
press START after=60
checkpoint pause_menu window=30
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press A after=60
checkpoint saving window=10
wait 60
wait 34
wait 120
checkpoint game_saved window=30
press A after=60

[load]
wait 900
press START after=120
checkpoint continue_menu window=30
press DOWN after=20
press A after=120
checkpoint load_slots window=30
press A after=180
checkpoint resumed window=30
